{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-craftplay-sand-art-bottles-10-sold-via-amazon-2607-0121","content_id":"6a5567a8-c49e-44b6-b627-d3142ab54be3","description":"Product Recall for Craftplay Sand Art Bottles (10) presenting a risk to health. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"d77466e1-9550-4380-ac8e-c90ad95592ba","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-05T08:54:07+01:00","id":"d77466e1-9550-4380-ac8e-c90ad95592ba","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-05T08:54:07+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a72ec1fdc689ac736a47702/2607-0121-product-recall-craftplay-sand-art.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Craftplay Sand Art Bottles (10) sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a risk to health as the sand inside the bottles may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been recalled from end users by Amazon.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment – Arts/Crafts/Needlework Sand Supplies</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Craftplay</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturer</td>\n      <td>Anthony Peters Mfg co Ltd</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model Number</td>\n      <td>AP2597</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASIN</td>\n      <td>B0B15J7N2B</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Other Product Identifiers</td>\n      <td>LPN IC 13758 0083, 26996</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Bottles of play sand sold in packs of 10.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_d77466e1-9550-4380-ac8e-c90ad95592ba\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a72ec1fdc689ac736a47702/2607-0121-product-recall-craftplay-sand-art.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a risk to health as the sand inside the bottles may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos. Asbestos is a banned substance because it poses a risk to health even at low levels of exposure.  </p>\n\n<p>The products do not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been recalled from end users by Amazon.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend owners stop using this product immediately and keep it out of the reach of children. Follow the below instructions for details on disposal and return of the product.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"disposal-instructions\">Disposal instructions:</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>Stop using the product immediately.    </li>\n  <li>If the sand is still in its packaging, place in a heavy-duty plastic bag, double tape it securely, label it clearly and store in a secure location out of the reach of children.    </li>\n  <li>If the sand has been used, clean up sites where the product was used using wet cloths to avoid generating dust. Wear gloves and a mask. Double bag the sand, gloves, mask and cloths.     </li>\n  <li>Keep children and other people away from areas where the sand has been used until the area has been cleaned.    </li>\n  <li>Return the product to store where specified by the retailer for a full refund.</li>\n  <li>If you are unable to return the product to the retailer, or the product was purchased via an online marketplace, follow the steps above and contact your local authority / access their website for guidance on safe disposal of asbestos in your area.</li>\n  <li>For further information, please contact the retailer or visit the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/asbestos-in-consumer-products\">GOV.UK page on asbestos in consumer products</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2607-0121</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-05T07:59:37Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"disposal-instructions","level":3,"text":"Disposal instructions:"},{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-05","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-05T08:59:37+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-craftplay-sand-art-bottles-10-sold-via-amazon-2607-0121","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-craftplay-sand-art-bottles-10-sold-via-amazon-2607-0121","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-craftplay-sand-art-bottles-10-sold-via-amazon-2607-0121","content_id":"6a5567a8-c49e-44b6-b627-d3142ab54be3","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-05T07:59:37Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Craftplay Sand Art Bottles (10) sold via Amazon (2607-0121)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/pro